From 71ae936f7f14c12638150b95dac937253b0b1897 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: noctis <970308389@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 00:41:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] NeuralNetworks: emulate Float16 on LoongArch64

Clang does not currently expose _Float16 for the LoongArch Android target, while NNAPI uses it throughout its reference CPU implementation. Provide a binary16-compatible wrapper backed by Eigen::half and enable it only for LoongArch64 device variants.\n\nPreserve implicit conversions, arithmetic promotion, comparisons, and constexpr construction needed by the existing NNAPI sources.

Change-Id: Ia9df3f722d97f784bd4c1bbf15f7477a6eefae55
